  "body": "The setup we have largely works if the values of the attributes are only strings-or-null, but that is no longer the case now we have element(s) references, and there's ambition to make that even less the case (e.g., by fixing https://github.com/w3c/aria/issues/1110).\r\n\r\nSo we probably need integration with reflect of sorts on the `ElementInternals` side. It would also help to know what would be ideal for the mapping to AT, which is somewhat unclear at this point as I don't think that's defined at all. I filed https://github.com/w3c/core-aam/issues/152 on that.\r\n\r\ncc @mrego @domenic @whatwg/a11y ",
